The '''Mojang Cape''' and the '''Classic Mojang Cape''' are [[Cape|capes]] that were given to employees of [[Mojang]] before it rebranded into Mojang Studios.

== Distribution ==
Neither of these capes were given out on {{BE}}.

=== Classic Mojang Cape ===
The Classic Mojang Cape was given to those employed by Mojang at any point between December 20, 2010 and October 7, 2015.

This cape was also given out to Mojang employees on ''[[Xbox 360 Edition]]''.<ref>{{tweet|PopsRamjet|1128979747382452224|archiveid=20220326205242|#minecraftmemories Time to pull another photo of out the archives :) Once upon a time we used to have the ability to turn capes on & off on in #MinecraftXBLA #MinecraftX360 This is the cape that Microsoft folks had when they played online! @mojang had one too & our 1st birthday!|May 16, 2019}}</ref><ref>Data dump showing the cape design: https://github.com/AdrianCassar/TitleManagedStorageArchiveXbox360/blob/main/584111F7/Mojang_Cape.png</ref>

=== Mojang Cape ===
The Mojang Cape was given to those employed by Mojang at any point between October 7, 2015 and July 25, 2021.

